ComposableKit
=============

ComposableKit is an independent implementation of the API of The Composable
Architecture (TCA), created by Point-Free. It mirrors the public API and the
names of TCA and of the Point-Free libraries TCA builds on, so that TCA's
documentation and examples can be followed in apps that support iOS 15.

ComposableKit is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Point-Free, Inc.
"The Composable Architecture" and "Point-Free" are names of Point-Free, Inc.

Credit goes to Point-Free for the original design and API of:

- The Composable Architecture
  https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-composable-architecture
- swift-case-paths            (case paths, @CasePathable)
- swift-dependencies          (@Dependency, DependencyKey, withDependencies)
- swift-identified-collections (IdentifiedArray)
- swift-sharing               (@Shared)
- swift-clocks                (TestClock, ImmediateClock)
- swift-concurrency-extras    (LockIsolated)
- swift-issue-reporting       (reportIssue)
- swift-custom-dump           (state diffs in TestStore failures)

